MCbJe-MyWL6MiMWnpt_sE_C5CVOcqV3P0zDjicVBev5PA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz1cBLtgjxcTr4IxSwonOZ5N9Oc29_wg-BVKIfRKHmgSQ&oe=69AD7DD5"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_03.png", "id": "1078013840882615", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499356638_1078013844215948_4431526408350712785_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4YaanuAf3JQQ7kNvwHWvowC&_nc_oc=AdlqjBW_Q5qO83FZ5YPykVxpuuQQefyrb7kJiDz2WZ3zwbr817t0NmlPE_3Gimq4SJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwfRl3z3P3RiYn3AGiZ7eaqrQQeUplkT-eppT0P8OHElw&oe=69AD6E8E"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_01.png", "id": "548187144806946", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324048_548187148140279_302708763491369627_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_awJPaypFD8Q7kNvwFtRfCJ&_nc_oc=AdlUapI2ewN0Vzj662Um6Haau3UOLErdFi72mLBgQJcp78RBNipVMwTttRpiueLdObk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxcsuJirTZpe7q19tXBEhi4YH2_MkRhOapLgwlzPjZf_A&oe=69AD6EF4"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_05.png", "id": "1416446512843773", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324939_1416446516177106_7952489805788314366_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0bX8CxYHN_cQ7kNvwEMw18z&_nc_oc=AdlxtOIWktIyAVqeH0Y29OReGvx8IoHWSDSF_Lrx8LpRv_wxcE7bOZT3_X3OD44Jeyw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzHUz5xxRTvMwBxrtqqEaXYER_YX4LFMjH8KmH1YKu9gQ&oe=69AD533A"}, {"file_name": "V8_Engine_06.png", "id": "1188825093024789", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499333143_1188825096358122_7698089225442683365_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yc26JDMkZ-0Q7kNvwHsV_oC&_nc_oc=AdlJy94rKz0BHDkTlJLDEeL94xxVo4Zrn7nC0LJzmstNRMSZhgZ9B7WHVVC7gz2p0-4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwZMcJwYJBLr_kiiGo1_kqExKKQTFTOz3PZ5qAIi7sDNQ&oe=69AD6B51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "V8 Engine Simulation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock the mysteries of automotive engineering with our cutting-edge V8 Engine Training Simulator. Immerse yourself in a virtual world where learning meets hands-on experience, allowing enthusiasts, students, and professionals to grasp the intricacies of V8 engine assembly like never before.\n\nPowered by state-of-the-art technology, our simulator utilises a real V8 engine model, providing an authentic and comprehensive learning experience. Whether you're a novice eager to explore the mechanics or a seasoned automotive enthusiast aiming to enhance your knowledge, our simulator caters to all skill levels.\n\nKey Features:\n\n1. Real Engine Integration: Our simulator boasts a genuine V8 engine, enabling users to interact with real components and understand their functions.\n\n2. Interactive Learning Modules: Dive into an array of interactive modules that cover every aspect of V8 engine assembly, from identifying parts to mastering the intricacies of fuel injection systems.\n\n3. Real-Time Feedback: Receive instant feedback on your assembly progress, allowing for continuous improvement and a deeper understanding of the engine's inner workings.\n\n4. Step-by-Step Tutorials: Guided by detailed step-by-step tutorials, users can progress at their own pace, ensuring a thorough grasp of each assembly stage.\n\n\n\n\nUnleash your passion for engines and master the art of V8 assembly like never before!\n", "short_description": "Discover the art of V8 engine assembly with our state-of-the-art Training Simulator! Featuring a real V8 engine, interactive modules, and step-by-step tutorials, our simulator caters to all skill levels. Gain hands-on experience, receive real-time feedback, and master the intricacies of automotive engineering. Elevate your knowledge with our immersive and authentic V8 Engine Training Simulator today! \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pastelcube.com/privacy-pol